@startuml activity-check-availability
skinparam backgroundColor white

|Customer / Admin|
start
:Trigger the check\n(pick dates in the booking form\nor submit it — UC4,\nor click "Confirm" — UC8);

|System|
:Load CONFIRMED reservations\nof the selected car\n(DRAFT and CANCELLED\nones are ignored);
if (Any of them overlaps the\nrequested time range?\n(existing start < requested end\nand existing end > requested start)) then (no)
  :Result: car available;
else (yes)
  :Result: car not available;
endif
:Return the result to the\ncalling use case (UC4 / UC8);

|Customer / Admin|
:See result\n(slot free and the flow continues,\nor "slot already taken" message);
stop
@enduml
